Package: usbwatch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6), adduser | passwd
Recommends: logrotate
Maintainer: USBWatch maintainers <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: file:///usr/share/doc/usbwatch/README.md
Description: USB device and file activity auditor with a local web console
 Logs every USB device plugged in (serial, VID:PID, vendor, product, class),
 every USB filesystem mounted, and all file activity on USB drives: files
 written to and read from the drive, deleted, renamed and executed, with the
 user and process responsible. Optional whitelist/blacklist blocking,
 recovery vault and SHA-256 hashing. Pure Python, no extra dependencies;
 the web console listens on localhost only by default and requires sign-in.
